## Information Still Lacking

We lack direct evidence either confirming or refuting the specific claim about a scam involving fake Santander bank cards being sent to customers. While various Santander-related frauds were documented, none matched the exact nature of the claim (physical fake cards being mailed to customers). A more targeted search specifically looking for this type of scam would be needed.

